# Commit message convention (PHASE-001 T9)
# Format: PHASE-001: <scope> — <change>  OR  docs: <change>  OR  chore: <change>
# Examples:
#   PHASE-001: domain-core — add Money rounding tests
#   docs: fix broken link in ARCHITECTURE_BASELINE
#   chore: bump pnpm to 9.15.9
#
# Rules:
# - One phase per commit (never mix PHASE-002 into PHASE-001 commit)
# - Append CHANGELOG.md entry for user-visible changes
# - No secrets, no .env, no business logic beyond phase scope
